	<string name="deletrear_resumen">A letter or symbol on its own is said by its name: bee, double you, number sign</string>
	<string name="tono_mayusculas">Raise pitch for capitals</string>
	<string name="tono_mayusculas_resumen">When spelling. At 0, «capital» is said first</string>
